<header class="kube-library-header">
  <div class="kube-library-container">
    <p class="kube-label">The CloudSecCorner workshop</p>
    <h1>Less theory.<br /><span>More hands-on understanding.</span></h1>
    <p class="kube-library-intro">Explore cloud and agentic security at your own pace. Start with AI agent security, learn zero-trust architectures, and practice practical defense engineering.</p>
    <div class="kube-library-links"><a href="/labs/agentic-cloud-security/">Start with Agent Security →</a><a href="/blog/">Looking for field notes? Read the guides →</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="lab-library" class="kube-library-container kube-library-section" data-content-library>
  <div class="kube-library-toolbar">
    <div><p class="kube-label">Practice &amp; explore</p><h2>Choose your next lab</h2></div>
    <div class="kube-library-search" hidden data-library-controls>
      <label for="lab-search">Find a lab</label>
      <input id="lab-search" type="search" placeholder="Search Agentic, Zero Trust, Threat Modeling…" data-library-search />
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="kube-library-count" role="status" data-library-count>{length(@labs)} labs to explore</p>
  <div class="kube-labs-grid">
    <%= for lab <- @labs do %>
      <article class="kube-lab-card" data-library-card>
        <div class="kube-lab-card-top"><span class="kube-lab-number" aria-hidden="true">&gt;_</span><p class="kube-label"><%= lab["category"] %></p></div>
        <h3><a href={"/labs/#{lab["id"]}/"}><%= lab["title"] %></a></h3>
        <p><%= lab["description"] %></p>
        <div class="kube-lab-card-tags" aria-label="Topics">
          <%= for tag <- Enum.take(lab["tags"] || [], 3) do %>
            <span><%= tag %></span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% end %>
  </div>
  <p class="kube-library-empty" hidden data-library-empty>No labs matched that filter. Try a broader search term.</p>
</section>

<section class="kube-contribute">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-screen-xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-10 lg:py-14">
    <div class="kube-contribute-copy">
      <p class="kube-label">Grow the workshop</p>
      <h2>Have a hands-on security exercise to share?</h2>
      <p>Submit a reproducible scenario, improve a step-by-step guide, or contribute labs for newly discovered agentic vulnerabilities.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kube-contribute-actions">
      <a class="kube-contribute-primary" href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner/cloudseccorner.github.io/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Contribution guide ↗</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner/cloudseccorner.github.io/issues/new?labels=new-lab" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Propose a lab ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
